    {
      "id": "racc_roi",
      "text": "3. COMPARE WHOLE IMAGE AND ROI\nBinary Threshold selects red-channel values above 30,000. Masked RACC fits and maps only the selected ROI; the unmasked node uses all voxels meeting both manual thresholds. The fitted relationship can therefore differ.",
