    },
    {
      "id": "racc_interpretation",
      "text": "4. READ THE MAGMA MAP\nThe 0-1 scalar map favours intensity pairs further along and nearer the fitted relationship. A larger theta penalizes departures from that relationship more strongly. Change theta in Parameters, calculate again and compare the maps. This qualitative visualization is not a binary overlap mask or a probability.",
